Hi<%= @user.profile&.display_name.present? ? " #{@user.profile.display_name}" : "" %>,

The organizer of <%= @event.title %> just updated some details for your registration:
<% if @changes[:price_cents] -%>
Price: <%= format_money(@changes[:price_cents][:from]) %> -> <%= format_money(@changes[:price_cents][:to]) %> <%= @event.currency.to_s.upcase %>
<% end -%>
<% if @changes[:start_at] -%>
Starts: <%= format_time(@changes[:start_at][:from]) %> -> <%= format_time(@changes[:start_at][:to]) %>
<% end -%>
<% if @changes[:end_at] -%>
Ends: <%= @changes[:end_at][:from] ? format_time(@changes[:end_at][:from]) : "—" %> -> <%= @changes[:end_at][:to] ? format_time(@changes[:end_at][:to]) : "—" %>
<% end -%>

Please review your registration: <%= @event_url %>

— The Rally team
